{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16107130","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16107130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1610713001:1":{"text":"또 매진?! 벌써 5일째 못 샀다구요!","source_cn":"唉，又售完了！我已经连续五天都没能喝到你们的特调饮品了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC93DC8CB80EF0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1610713002:1":{"text":"저 여기 단골인데... 스페셜 드링크 우선 구매권 같은 건 없나요?! 단골 혜택 같은 거요!","source_cn":"我可是你们的常客！难道连优先买特调饮品的机会都没有？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F095812DE3193D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610713003:1":{"text":"혹시 일부러 다 팔렸다고 하시는 건 아니죠? 어디서 들어본 적 있는 것 같은데... 그... 헝거 마케팅이라고 하던데!","source_cn":"你们该不会是故意的吧？我听人讲过，这叫……哦对了，叫饥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x610A074C15EC4516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610713004:1":{"text":"음, 파엔 씨, 저희 단골손님이신 건 당연히 잘 알고 있습니다만, 저희는 그런 헝거 마케팅 같은 전략은 사용하지 않습니다.","source_cn":"呃，帕恩先生，我当然知道您是小店忠实的顾客。但实在抱歉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACE107A208BFA13D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610713005:1":{"text":"다만, 저희 스페셜 드링크는 워낙 희귀하고 구하기 어려운 원료를 사용하는 탓에 한정 수량으로 판매되고 있으니, 이 점 양해 부탁드립니다.","source_cn":"每日特调限量，是因为我们调制这种饮品所用的部分原料很稀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B119AC7C45B2B8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610713006:1":{"text":"그럼 난 어떡해요! 다른 음료는 이미 많이 마셔봐서 더 이상 마시고 싶지 않단 말이에요!","source_cn":"那怎么办……菜单上其他的饮品我已经喝过很多次了，就想喝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85896F479F2B0020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610713007:1":{"text":"단골손님이시니, 저희 가게의 <style=\"highlight\">퍼스널 블렌딩</style>을 한 번 시도해 보시겠어요?","source_cn":"既然您是熟客了，那要不要试试小店的<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF840F3A980C39CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610713008:1":{"text":"오? 그게 뭐죠?","source_cn":"哦？听起来很有趣，这是什么东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76AB0EA62A890364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610713009:1":{"text":"저희 단골손님에게만 제공하는 <style=\"highlight\">커스텀 음료 서비스</style>입니다.","source_cn":"这是小店为熟客提供的<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA6E9BF16C5008C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610713010:1":{"text":"커스텀이요? 음료를 커스텀 한다고요?","source_cn":"定制？这也能个人定制？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x131CDBBBC5CA19FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","var